						$("body").addClass("js");
					</script></div><ul id="top" class="accessibleLinks"><li><a href="#content">Skip to main content</a></li><li><a href="#plainViewNav">Skip to navigation</a></li></ul><div id="layout1"><div id="header"><h2><img alt="Legislation.gov.uk" src="/images/chrome/plainViewHeaderTitle.gif" /></h2><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/contents">Back to full view</a></div><div id="background"></div><div id="layout2"><h1 id="pageTitle" class="pageTitle">Betting, Gaming and Lotteries Act 1963 (repealed)</h1><div class="interface" id="plainViewNav"></div><div id="content"><div id="viewLegContents" xml:lang="en"><div class="LegSnippet" id="tocControlsAdded"><div class="LegContents LegClearFix"><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/introduction">Introductory Text</a></span></p></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I">Part I  Betting</a></p><ol><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/general-restrictions-on-betting"> General restrictions on betting</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/1">1.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/1"> Restriction on use of premises for betting transactions with persons resorting thereto. </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/2">2.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/2"> Restriction on bookmaking except under bookmaker’s permit.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/3">3.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/3"> Agent of bookmaker or Totalisator Board to be authorised and registered.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/4"> Restriction of pool betting.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/5"> Restriction of betting on tracks.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/6"> Restriction of bookmaking on tracks.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/7"> General restrictions on betting</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/8"> Prohibition of betting in streets and public places.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/licensed-betting-offices"> Licensed betting offices</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/9">9.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/9"> Betting office licences and betting agency permits.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/10">10.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/10"> Conduct of licensed betting offices.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/10A">10A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/10A"> Cancellation of betting office licence</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/special-provisions-with-respect-to-bookmakers-and-betting-agency-permits"> Special provisions with respect to bookmaker’s and betting agency permits</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/11">11.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/11"> Cancellation of and disqualification for bookmaker’s or betting agency permit.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/the-totalisator-board-and-pool-betting-on-horse-races"> The Totalisator Board and pool betting on horse races</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/12">12.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/12"> Horserace Totalisator Board.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/13">13.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/13"> Approval of horse racecourses by Totalisator Board. </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/14">14.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/14"> Functions of Totalisator Board with respect to betting on horse races. </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/15">15.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/15"> Additional powers and duties of Totalisator Board.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/special-provisions-with-respect-to-licensed-tracks"> Special provisions with respect to licensed tracks</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/16">16.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/16"> Totalisators on licensed tracks.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/16A">16A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/16A"> Licensing of inter-track betting schemes.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/17">17.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/17"> Special rights of occupier of licensed track where totalisator is operated.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/18">18.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/18"> Charges to bookmakers on licensed tracks.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/19">19.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/19"> Occupiers of licensed tracks not to have an interest in bookmaking thereon.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/20">20.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/20"> Saving for right of occupier of licensed track to prohibit betting.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/special-provisions-with-respect-to-young-persons"> Special provisions with respect to young persons</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/21">21.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/21"> Betting with young persons.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/22">22.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/22"> Betting circulars not to be sent to young persons.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/power-of-entry-on-tracks"> Power of entry on tracks</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/23">23.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/23"> Power of entry on tracks.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/contributions-for-benefit-of-horse-racing-by-bookmakers-and-totalisator-board"> Contributions for benefit of horse racing by bookmakers and Totalisator Board</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/24">24.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/24"> Horserace Betting Levy Board.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/25">25.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/25"> General powers and duties of Levy Board. </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/26">26.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/26"> Bookmakers’ Committee.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27">27.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27"> The levy</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27A">27A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27A">Profits as a bookmaker</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27B">27B.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27B">Stake money</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27C">27C.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27C">Betting exchange commission</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27D">27D.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27D">The exempt amount</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27E">27E.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/27E">Power to obtain information</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/28">28.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/28"> Assessment of ... levy.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/28A">28A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/28A">Prohibition on disclosure of information</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/29">29.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/29"> Levy appeal tribunals. </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/29A">29A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/29A">Meaning of “leviable bet”</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/29B">29B.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/29B">Meaning of other terms</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/30">30.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/30"> Contributions by successor company to the Totalisator Board.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/accounts-and-reports-of-levy-board-and-totalisator-board"> Accounts and reports of Levy Board and Totalisator Board</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/31">31.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/31"> Accounts of, and reports by, Levy Board and Totalisator Board.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/I/crossheading/betting-workers-sunday-working"> Betting workers: Sunday working</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/31A">31A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/31A"> Rights of betting workers as respects Sunday working.</a></span></p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/part/II">Part II  Gaming</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/3239.">32—39.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/3239.">. . . . . . . . . ....</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/2/section/40">40.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsT